  formalisation: 'Every machine here trades one quantity for its reciprocal through
    a single ratio: effort times its distance equals load times its distance. Nothing
    in this cathedral is exempt.'
  capability: Turn a small effort into a large force, or a small motion into a large
    one -- never both -- and say which trade a lever, a gear train or a pulley just
    made.
